prompt:
Keep the reader name field, then add a number-of-books field and repeated book title and author inputs controlled by that count.

Current Forml source:
form "Reading Survey" {
  field reader_name: text ui { label: "Reader name" } validate { required }
}

completion:
form "Reading Survey" {
  field reader_name: text ui { label: "Reader name" } validate { required }
  field book_count: integer ui { label: "Number of books" } validate { required min: 1 max: 20 }
  repeat count = book_count {
    field book_title: text ui { label: "Book title" } validate { required }
    field author: text ui { label: "Author" } validate { required }
  }
}

form "Product Feedback" {
